"Burning Hells": {
  "index": 0,
  "category": "rituals",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Ritual of the Burning Hells"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This forbidden ritual summons a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Demon Lord",
          "color": "dark_red"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nThese demons often offer power to those that seek it, though with power always comes a price. Demons are very powerful, and respect only those that can withstand such power. "
        },
        {
          "text": "Proper precautions should be taken",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " before attempting to make an bargain with a demon "
        },
        {
          "text": "lest the summoner find themselves burned alive",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nTo mollify the rage of the demon, I should have an offering of a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mote of Fire",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " to offer the demon, "
        },
        {
          "text": "in addition to the ritual reagents",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Allying oneself with such entities will almost assuredly make enemies of others.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nAlternatively, performing this ritual in a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Demon Arena",
          "color": "dark_red"
        },
        {
          "text": " will challenge the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Demon Lord",
          "color": "dark_red"
        },
        {
          "text": " to a duel."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
